<title>CHINA: RESEARCH ALERT-GOLDMAN SEES HSI 17,288 AT YR-END.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-GOLDMAN SEES HSI 17,288 AT YR-END.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said on Thursday that it had upgraded its year-end 1997 target for Hong Kong's Hang Seng Index by 10 percent to 17,288 from 15,800.</p>
</text>
